interaction service-site-packages-research-desk
  source service-site
  destination research-desk
  relation packages_workspace
  preserves the retained search records and receipts, and a worked example whose quotations are located in their abstracts at build time
  drops nothing a visitor edits; the package carries no visitor state
  forbidden_inference a packaged workspace -> a published one; publication is a separate deploy
  invalidates_on synthesis sources, retained search, worked-example quotations
  witness components/BonfyreServiceSite/synthesis-material.mjs
